                    <li><strong>Books of Accounts / Financial Statements:</strong> P&amp;L, balance sheet, audit report (for business scrutiny)</li>
                    <li><strong>Capital Gains Statements:</strong> Broker statements, MF statements, property sale documents</li>
                </ul>
