                    <p><strong>Mumbai-Specific Tip:</strong> Before responding to any notice, download the latest AIS from the portal and compare with your ITR line by line. Many Mumbai mismatches arise from: timing differences (FY boundary), TDS on FDs not reported as income, dividend income from demat accounts, and MF capital gains from SIP redemptions. Patron performs comprehensive AIS reconciliation for all Mumbai notice clients.</p>
